{
  "name": "Mostaql Projects Hunter",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a freelance project matching assistant.\n\nYour task is to evaluate whether a freelance project is suitable for a freelancer based on the project's actual technical requirements and the freelancer's skills.\n\nPROJECT:\nTitle:\n{{ $json.title }}\n\nDescription:\n{{ $json.description }}\n\nFREELANCER SKILLS:\n{{ $json.skills }}\n\nMATCHING RULES:\n\n1. Compare the actual technical requirements of the project with the freelancer's skills.\n2. Do NOT match based only on individual keywords.\n3. Consider the overall scope and required technologies.\n4. HIGH_MATCH:\n   - The freelancer can complete most or all of the project using their existing skills.\n   - Only small or non-critical gaps may exist.\n5. MEDIUM_MATCH:\n   - The freelancer can complete a significant part of the project but needs to learn or use some additional technologies.\n6. LOW_MATCH:\n   - The project requires skills that are mostly unrelated to the freelancer's skills.\n7. Score must be between 0 and 100:\n   - HIGH_MATCH: 75-100\n   - MEDIUM_MATCH: 40-74\n   - LOW_MATCH: 0-39\n8. should_apply must be:\n   - true for HIGH_MATCH\n   - true for MEDIUM_MATCH only if the freelancer can realistically complete the project\n   - false for LOW_MATCH\n9. matched_skills must contain only skills explicitly supported by the freelancer's skills.\n10. missing_skills must contain important technical requirements that are not present in the freelancer's skills.\n11. If should_apply is false, proposal must be an empty string.\n12. If should_apply is true, write a short, professional proposal based specifically on the project requirements and the freelancer's relevant skills. Do not invent experience or skills.\n\nIMPORTANT OUTPUT RULES:\n\n- Return ONLY valid JSON.\n- Do not use Markdown.\n- Do not add explanations before or after the JSON.\n- Use exactly these 6 fields:\n  match\n  score\n  matched_skills\n  missing_skills\n  should_apply\n  arabic proposal\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\n\n{\n  \"match\": \"HIGH_MATCH\",\n  \"score\": 90,\n  \"matched_skills\": [\"Python\", \"RAG\", \"LLMs\"],\n  \"missing_skills\": [\"Pinecone\"],\n  \"should_apply\": true,\n  \"proposal\": \"...\"\n}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
